  <bib:Article rdf:about="#ircot">
    <z:itemType>conferencePaper</z:itemType>
    <dc:title>Interleaving Retrieval with Chain-of-Thought Reasoning for Knowledge-Intensive Multi-Step Questions</dc:title>
    <dc:date>2023</dc:date>
    <z:url>https://aclanthology.org/2023.acl-long.557/</z:url>
    <dc:identifier>DOI: 10.18653/v1/2023.acl-long.557</dc:identifier>
    <z:extra>发表状态：已同行评审，ACL 2023 Main Long 正式论文。阅读优先级：P0-多跳检索基线。为什么读：IRCoT 将检索和逐步推理交错执行，直接说明子查询必须随已得到的桥接证据变化，是比较检索前一次改写与检索后闭环修复的关键基线。精读问题：每轮检索查询怎样从推理状态生成？停止规则是什么？累计错误证据如何影响后续跳？在 HotpotQA、2Wiki、MuSiQue 上如何分别评价检索与答案？</z:extra>
    <bib:authors><rdf:Seq>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Harsh</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Trivedi</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Niranjan</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Balasubramanian</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
