    <bib:pages>7080–7106</bib:pages>
    <z:tags><rdf:Bag><rdf:li><z:AutomaticTag><rdf:value>GrowRAG-核心精读</rdf:value></z:AutomaticTag></rdf:li><rdf:li><z:AutomaticTag><rdf:value>P0-经验笔记</rdf:value></z:AutomaticTag></rdf:li><rdf:li><z:AutomaticTag><rdf:value>同行评审-EACL-Main</rdf:value></z:AutomaticTag></rdf:li></rdf:Bag></z:tags>
  </bib:Article>

  <bib:Article rdf:about="#reasoningbank">
    <z:itemType>conferencePaper</z:itemType>
    <dc:title>ReasoningBank: Scaling Agent Self-Evolving with Reasoning Memory</dc:title>
    <dc:date>2026</dc:date>
    <z:url>https://iclr.cc/virtual/2026/poster/10007887</z:url>
    <dc:identifier>arXiv:2509.25140</dc:identifier>
    <z:extra>发表状态：已同行评审并接收为 ICLR 2026 Poster。阅读优先级：P0-结构化推理经验最强近邻。为什么读：它从成功和失败轨迹中自我整理可泛化推理策略，并以 Title、Description、Content 形式持续检索、提炼和合并；本项目不能再把“压缩 CoT 为经验”称为首创。精读问题：成功与失败怎样自判？一条记忆的作用域和证据从哪里来？合并会不会丢失反例？MaTTS 增益中有多少来自额外采样而非记忆？</z:extra>
